note TWIN of ce-sized-oob-fold.om with unroll removed (OM-2 unit).
note Contract section 4 lines 105-106: the index add i 1 folds to the constant 4 in the i = 3 copy, a
note constant outside the SIZED array a4: error 21 at compile time (line 10, the put).
om2
fn main to int
a4 = new ulong 4 7
s = ulong 0
for i ulong 4
s = add s get a4 i
put a4 add i 1 s
end
ret int s
end
